  "summary": {
    "heading": "What this means for you",
    "body": [
      "Burton's FY2026-27 adopted City levy is 13.2948 mills. Of that, 9.2948 mills are voter-approved Police and Fire levies; 4.0000 mills support general City operations under the City Charter.",
      "At $50,000 of taxable value, the City portion is about $665 a year. The latest complete published bill rates are from 2025 and range from about $2,093 to $2,674 at that taxable value, depending on school district.",
      "County, schools, the State, ISD, college, transit, airport, and other authorities receive their own portions; those amounts do not become City revenue."
    ]
  },
